/* test_merkle.c — L0/L1 for Merkle batch attestation core (B-24.3).
 *
 * test_hardcoded: independent cross-check — leaves, root, and the index-3
 * proof below were generated by tools-side Python (hashlib, see
 * gen_merkle_vec.py transcript in the B-24.3 work notes), not by this
 * implementation. Byte equality here means two implementations agree.
 * Remaining tests: structural properties (odd promotion, determinism,
 * tamper-breaks, proof roundtrips over n = 1..9, negatives, guards).
 */
